(footprint "CST3015"
	(version 20231120)
	(generator "temper-hand")
	(generator_version "8.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Coilcraft CST3015 SMT current sense transformer (CST3015-100ED, 1:100, 88A sensed, 5000Vrms reinforced isolation, >=8mm creepage/clearance, AEC-Q200 Grade 1, -40..+125C). Land pattern hand-built from the official Recommended Land Pattern, Coilcraft Document 1608-2 rev 09/08/25 (https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/df31d5fe-b3af-4586-82a7-7b773ac9f838/cst3015.pdf). PRIMARY pads 1/2: 9.0 x 4.8mm on 15.36mm centres (datasheet land pattern 9.0 pad width, 6.36 inner gap); these land a 7.36 x 3.8mm terminal, giving 0.82mm extension per side. SECONDARY pads 3/4: 3.0 x 4.6mm on 13.76mm centres (datasheet 3.0 pad width, 10.76 inner gap). Row centres 18.5mm apart outer-to-outer. Body 23.0 x 30.0mm max, 15.2mm max height. PAD NUMBERING matches the datasheet's own pin numbers and the atopile component CST3015_100E directly (primary = pins/pads 1 and 2, secondary = pins/pads 3 and 4) -- unlike the CST2010 footprint, no remapping is required. Silkscreen dot marks pin 1, matching the dot on the part body per the datasheet's 'Dot indicates pin 1'. CONFIDENCE: the secondary geometry is cross-verified -- 3.0mm pad + 10.76mm inner gap = 13.76mm centre-to-centre, which independently equals the 13.76 +/-0.15mm secondary span dimensioned on the component drawing. The primary geometry is consistent (9.0mm land for a 7.36mm terminal) but is not independently cross-verified. VERIFY AGAINST THE DATASHEET DRAWING BEFORE FABRICATION.")
	(tags "current transformer CST3015 coilcraft SMD isolated")
	(property "Reference" "REF**"
